{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"43":"General Behavior (Kitab Al-Adab)"},"section_detail":{"43":{"hadithnumber_first":4773,"hadithnumber_last":5274,"arabicnumber_first":4773,"arabicnumber_last":5274,"name_native":"সাধারণ আচরণ (কিতাব আল-আদাব)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4897,"arabicnumber":4897,"text":"। আবূ হুরাইরাহ (রাঃ) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। এক ব্যক্তি আবূ বাকর (রাঃ)-কে গালি দিচ্ছিল ... অতঃপর পূর্বোক্ত হাদীসের অনুরূপ।[1] হাসান।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":43,"hadith":125}}]}